<title>USA: Northern States Power unit buys debt.</title>
<headline>Northern States Power unit buys debt.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>NRG Energy Inc, a unit of Northern States Power Co, said it has purchased the senior secured debt of Mid-Continent Power Co of Pryor, Okla.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>It said Mid-Continent supported the transaction and views NRG's acquisition of its senior debt as the first step in the restructuring of the company's finances.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
